      }
    ],
    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 64,
        "text": "So, how was the first week with the new scheduling system?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "8ba3fc25809567e8533d4fe44f292ec65652772e95fd4603f61413c165253623",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 74,
        "sourceEnd": 178,
        "text": "Honestly? Mixed. Some things are better, but most of the changes feel like they were decided without us.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "301f62f849a54b2f3c0ba69ee93bbe3e842049b0c5bfa7fa81baf66eff03f6be",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 186,
        "sourceEnd": 278,
        "text": "What do you mean? I thought the whole point was to give teams more control over their hours.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "3e894876645a33235e487c2049e31d51ae6b7773ed7ac4106eea40d7da3753e1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 288,
        "sourceEnd": 458,
        "text": "That's what the email said. But when I asked my manager, she told me that all requests still have to go through her. So we fill in a form, and she approves or rejects it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "77c5c7f839d35efb59ab409b489b0b835934cc0a3376697705f7a9dd88e39a39",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 466,
        "sourceEnd": 531,
        "text": "Hmm. That doesn't sound like autonomy to me. Did she explain why?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "5e0dd4475c23e2bfbfd95d55706818cef53620ba125ec680179fdc3ec4ffd991",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 541,
        "sourceEnd": 753,
        "text": "She said the company needs to make sure there are enough people on the floor at busy times. I get that. But she also claimed that most staff prefer having a manager check their requests. I'm not sure that's true.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "270611a88fe64ad260cc384e068aaecc0e08daaab1581f41438e5ba170857b61",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 761,
        "sourceEnd": 786,
        "text": "Did anyone ask the staff?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f617417810513abdeef8e6e11cca11c354fef6acae1d4bd39a39070b1f99eda6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 796,
        "sourceEnd": 940,
        "text": "Not that I know of. That's the problem. She said, 'We consulted everyone,' but I never saw a survey. Maybe some people were asked. I don't know.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "d8c3532d4b82be68d82defbbbde488fc5ef9cbb795b927380a700133cea1965a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 948,
        "sourceEnd": 976,
        "text": "So what are you going to do?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "2106b3e8d6342ca3277e6c76d5d89ae509693b7ab2e422681b402c4507cca9eb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 986,
        "sourceEnd": 1196,
        "text": "I'm thinking of writing a short note to the team. I'll ask people whether they were consulted, and I'll suggest that we share the results with management. If most people say they weren't asked, that's evidence.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "2c277daa0a02e8d0ea7f89d75de591aaddd3f89fd696a18d60d59eeaff7e53ad",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1204,
        "sourceEnd": 1388,
        "text": "That's a good idea. But be careful with the wording. If you write 'management ignored us', people will get defensive. Maybe say 'we would like to understand how the decision was made'.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "5fcace036f36d5f094bbc658e9be1fc3c216891d855fb7ae591a69300883c52a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 1398,
        "sourceEnd": 1480,
        "text": "Right. And I should avoid saying 'everyone agrees with me'. I don't know that yet.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "5d279de178c7e1fe9568cd1d0826ee6d8955327b0a39e070956d48d31a4b9ffc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1488,
        "sourceEnd": 1615,
        "text": "Exactly. Use words like 'some' and 'many' until you have the numbers. Then you can say 'most' or 'all' if the data supports it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a57fda4b5b9ce734379b81eb8c3f724abc0e2a3b8cc65f073fb01a484907576f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 1625,
        "sourceEnd": 1696,
        "text": "Okay. I'll draft something tonight and send it to you before I post it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f34c737d6ef426c9c96bfcfcdfd5f4fdb83bc4ce50369f775dce8fec6235dd18",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1704,
        "sourceEnd": 1773,
        "text": "Good. And Daniel — remember, the goal is a conversation, not a fight.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1b2a0d934514a354b0026b324978c3a8320ad3396927f56f55177e05d36388d1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 1783,
        "sourceEnd": 1804,
        "text": "I know. Thanks, Maya.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "592cf188d7e22e56d85b9368b658da00b72a9d453d75703f257396ffa74a6bf3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
